     3173   on ctrl-f of sch-date in frame Dialog-Frame
     3174   do:
     3175     if (can-query (self, "sensitive")
     3176        and
     3177        self :sensitive = true
     3178        )
     3179     or (can-query (self, "read-only")
     3180        and
